# Ring depth and held buffer around rx_buf_size=5440 (two buffers to a
# 9000-byte frame, so 512 entries hold 256 frames and 256 hold 128): each
# depth with the buffer that holds 1 MiB of data at this buffer size
# (701440: a frame's truesize is 11136 against 16640) and with 1 MiB.
# The first line is 16k-28-copy-rxbuf5440.plan's cell.
#     RX_LINGER_US=50 PLACE=1 STEP_BS=8M STEP_JOBS=16 PRP_DIR=/hs/stripe/zcbudget TRIM=/hs/stripe
512 701440 0 prp step-copy-n16
512 1048576 0 prp step-copy-n16
256 701440 0 prp step-copy-n16
256 1048576 0 prp step-copy-n16
